# Real durable allowance approval/status tools, with no model invocation.
name: Explicit call allowance approval and restart-safe status
size: 80x24
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NO_COLOR
env: KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | shell-ready
type: run campaign:approve-allowance {"investigationId":"offline-study","expectedRevision":0,"model":"openai-codex:gpt-5.5","maxProviderCalls":9,"protectedReviewCalls":3,"reason":"Offline TUI test; no provider execution"}
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 REVIEW ALLOWANCE | allowance-terms
expect: Total provider calls: 9
expect: Protected review calls: 3
expect: openai-codex:gpt-5.5
expect: Dollar ceiling: not enforced
ask: Can the operator review the exact allowance before approving, with no dollar-ceiling or automatic-work promise?
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 Read remaining terms to approve | allowance-first-page
expect-not: y approve
keys: y
live-snap: hidden-terms-cannot-approve
expect: REVIEW ALLOWANCE
expect: PgUp/PgDn read · Esc cancel
ask: Are paging and cancellation clear while approval waits for the remaining terms?
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 y approve | allowance-final-page
expect: starts no jobs
ask: Can the operator reach the remaining terms and approve at 40x12 without resizing?
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 20 Total provider calls: 9 | allowance-terms-restored
expect: Protected review calls: 3
keys: y
require-live-snap: 20 run receipt · completed | approved
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 20 Allowance approved; no jobs started | approval-receipt
expect: no jobs started
expect: 0/9
expect: protected review
ask: Does the result show the exact approved calls, model and protected review allocation, without implying scans started or dollar charges are bounded?
submit: run campaign:allowance {"investigationId":"offline-study"}
require-live-snap: 20 Investigation allowance: offline-study revision 1 | allowance-status
expect: Unresolved calls: 0
expect: not enforced
ask: Is the durable allowance understandable and inspectable without credentials or another model action?
keys: C-c
